# Input

```sass
.alpha, .beta
  color: red
  /* block comment */
  // line comment
  &:hover
    color: blue

@media (min-width: 100px)
  .gamma
    color: green

```


# Formatted

```sass
.alpha, .beta
	color: red
	/* block comment */
	// line comment
	&:hover
		color: blue

@media (min-width: 100px)
	.gamma
		color: green

```
